    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella, the Ministerof Higher Education and Highways, on the Recommendation of the University Grants Commission, do by this Order, amendthe Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1448/27 of June 09, 2006 (as last amended by Orderpublished in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2005/14 of February 08, 2017), which specifies the Faculties and the Departmentsof the University of Colombo, Sri Lanka, which is deemed, by virtue of the provisions of section 139 of the aforesaid Act, tobe a University established under section 21 of the said Act, by the addition immediately after the entry \" 10. Department ofBuddhist Studies\" appearing in Column II of the Schedule which corresponds to the item \" Faculty of Arts\" appearing inColumn I of the Schedule of the following entry:-",
